    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man conscripted into the Finnish military.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Finland, service is mandatory \u2014 and you don\u2019t know how it\u2019s going to play out. You\u2019ll have to get used to a new setting and new rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions shape how things turn out \u2014 for you, and for those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-rich experience with elements of <strong>drama</strong>, <strong>comedy</strong>, and <strong>romance</strong>\u2026 if you can call it that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <i>Part One</i> of a multi-part story. It is a standalone release, and future parts will be released separately. Stay tuned for updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: around 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available for Windows</p>",
